# Runtime / per-setup state, never committed: the board list and register
# dumps, the picoammeter and Graphite settings, the ELOG and Telegram
# credentials, the calibrations and the data itself. All of it is written with
# defaults on first start, so a fresh clone needs none of it — and a committed
# copy would overwrite whatever the DAQ machine is actually set to.
/conf/
/calib/
/data/
/cache/
*.log
